# cookies.txt — one file for ALL platforms (YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, TikTok)
#
# Export while logged in to EACH platform you need:
#   1. youtube.com   → export current site
#   2. facebook.com  → export current site (append or re-export all)
#   3. instagram.com → export current site
#   4. tiktok.com    → export current site
#
# Or use one export from a browser profile logged into all of them.
# The file MUST contain SID + LOGIN_INFO for YouTube age-restricted videos.
#
# Coolify: mount at /app/cookies.txt — never commit to Git.
#
# Verify: GET /api/health
#   cookies_has_login: true
#   cookies_youtube_entries > 0
